      <h1>Aayush Kucheria</h1>
      <span class="location">Based in Helsinki</span>
      <p class="intro">Researcher and interface thinker. I care about AI being good for the people it touches — especially where a human and a model actually meet.</p>
    </header>

    <section id="work" aria-labelledby="work-heading">
      <h2 id="work-heading">work</h2>
      <article>
        <h3><a href="https://groundless.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Groundless Alignment →</a></h3>
        <p>Design × alignment. Interfaces as alignment surfaces — making AI legible, contestable, humane. Fellowship to full-time over 1.5 years.</p>
        <div class="meta"><span>AISC 2026 team lead</span><span>guest lecturer, Gabriel Weil's AI &amp; Law '26</span></div>
      </article>
